# Data guard

Read `.cursor/skills/supabase-data-guard/SKILL.md` before editing these files.

Challenge values live only in `store.db.set.challenge`. Empty or non-numeric fields keep 312 and 500. Do not write 0.

```js
// BAD: save the rest after a bad date
fields.forEach(saveField);

// GOOD: abort the whole save
if (badDate) { toast('e_valid'); return; }
await store.commit(mutator);
```

On `syncToSupabase` failure, restore local `db` and `snap`, then rethrow. Do not pretend the remote write was undone. Empty exports toast `empty` and skip `saveBlob`.
